data: {"id": "3716312a211642b5-thinking-parallel_evidence-2280", "run_id": "3716312a211642b5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze the evidence collected for the Pod `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` with the candidate hypothesis \"OOMKilled 的直接原因待验证\".\n\n**Entity Confirmation:**\n- Pod: `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` in `aiops-case-08`, Node: `node2`, IP: `172.16.104.42`, UID: `cfa13c1e-da2a-4e37-8baa-ec4be4c24c35`\n- Container: `app` using image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- Memory Limit: **64Mi**, Request: **24Mi**\n\n**Kubernetes State (kubec", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 10, "ts_ms": 1788799459597, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

