data: {"id": "3716312a211642b5-final", "run_id": "3716312a211642b5", "seq": 2285, "ts_ms": 1788799482061, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | OOMKilled | Pod aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr 持续 CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Exit Code: 137; Container last_terminated_reason: OOMKilled | 明确容器因内存超限被内核 OOM Killer 终止的直接状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container resource_limit.memory: 64Mi; resource_request.memory: 24Mi | 设定了严格的 64Mi 硬限制，为内存溢出提供量化基准 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值从 3.9Mi 增长至 61.9Mi (接近 64Mi 硬限制) | 证实应用运行期间内存占用随时间显著增长并逼近限制 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `memory allocation advanced` 日志 pattern：`allocated_mib` 从 12 增至 42 | 记录应用内部分配内存持续增长，与 Metric 峰值增长相互印证 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow | `GET /work` 请求 9 次 (响应 200)，关联属性 `aiops.observed_mode: oom_growth` | 确认特定业务请求触发了上述内存增长模式，且应用逻辑正常运行直至崩溃 |\n| 6 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container restart_count: 6; Reason: CrashLoopBackOff | 展示因 OOMKilled 导致的 Pod 持续崩溃循环现象 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nMetric 显示的内存增长（~62Mi）与 Logging 记录的应用内部内存分配（42Mi）趋势一致，证明内存消耗来自应用本身而非外部注入。Tracing 中的 `oom_growth` 模式明确关联了 `GET /work` 请求与内存增长行为。所有证据均指向内存硬限制（64Mi）无法容纳应用峰值内存需求，从而导致 OOMKilled。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用启动 OOM 模拟增长模式 (FAILURE_MODE=oom_growth) → 处理 /work 请求时内存持续分配并增长 → 超过 cgroup 硬限制 (64Mi) → 触发内核 OOM Killer (Exit Code 137) → 容器 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为：**容器内存限制（64Mi）过低**。\n\n证据显示，应用在处理 `GET /work` 请求时，其工作集内存（Metric 峰值约 61.9Mi）和内部分配（Logging 最高 42Mi）随请求持续增加，迅速逼近并触发了 64Mi 的硬限制（`container.resource_limit.memory`）。这导致容器被 OOMKilled（退出码 137），进而引发 Pod 的 CrashLoopBackOff 循环。Tracing 中的 `oom_growth` 属性进一步证实了这是受控的内存增长行为，而非异常泄漏或突发攻击。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 11.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 665.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 665.0s (Evidence 653.2s, RCA 11.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 693.819, "metrics": {"run_id": "3716312a211642b5", "mttr": {"value": "11.6m", "seconds": 693.8181099891663, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-oomkilled"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 693818.1099891663, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 653312.18957901, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 22, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 24, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 74686.23232841492, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 33344.47121620178}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18344.14768218994, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 665047.6541519165, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10403.08928489685, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

